OL,3,GNEWSAFund to help businesses switch to
OL,4,Agreen vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #2m fund has been launched to help
OL,7,Fbusinesses switch their vehicles to
OL,8,Fgreener vehicles, Bradford Council has
OL,9,Fannounced.
OL,11,FReform UK council leader Stephen Place
OL,12,Fsaid it would help businesses counter
OL,13,Fthe rising cost of petrol and diesel as
OL,14,Fwell as modernise their fleets.
OL,16,FThe funding is part of Bradford
OL,17,FCouncil's Clean Air programme, which
OL,18,Fwill allow businesses to apply for up
OL,19,Fto #16,000 in support.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
