OL,3,GNEWSAFund to help businesses switch to
OL,4,Agreen vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnouncing the fund at the Scale Up
OL,7,FBradford event on Tuesday, Place said
OL,8,Fit would help businesses invest in
OL,9,Fcleaner, more efficient technology to
OL,10,F"future proof their operations for
OL,11,Fyears to come".
